===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# A way of speaking slowly while lengthening vowel sounds and running words together, characteristic of some [[w:Southern American English|Southern US accents]], as well as [[w:Australian_English|Broad Australian]], [[w:New_ Zealand_English|Broad New Zealand]] and [[w:Scots_language|Scots]].

